    "name":  "Pendant Lamp - SEAGRASS - for LED E27",
    "reference":  "SPD92105",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSeagrass Pendant Lamp for LED E27,\u003c/strong\u003e Add a touch of distinction and warmth to your home with this seagrass pendant lamp. \u003cstrong\u003eIts natural and elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e integrates perfectly with modern and minimalist styles, creating a cozy and sophisticated atmosphere in any space. Ideal for those seeking functional lighting with a unique decorative touch. Transform your space with style and light!\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"/en/led-bulbs-lamps/base-types/e27\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"\u003eE27 LED BULB\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003ePendant Light - SEAGRASS - for LED E27\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover the \u003cstrong\u003eSeagrass Fibre Pendant Light\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003efor \u003cstrong\u003eLED E27\u003c/strong\u003e, the perfect choice to transform any space with its natural, elegant design. This pendant light is ideal for anyone looking to add a unique, welcoming decorative touch to their home or business without giving up the functionality and efficiency of modern lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe light\u0026nbsp;\u003cstrong\u003eis handcrafted from natural Seagrass;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003ea natural fibre that grows in water. The weaves produced with this material are extremely hard-wearing and elegant,\u0026nbsp;usually sourced in Asia, and are woven together to form a unique and distinctive structure. This construction technique not only enhances its aesthetic appearance but also gives it exceptional durability.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Elegant, Minimalist Design:\u003c/strong\u003e The seagrass fibre pendant light stands out for its sophisticated, minimalist design, which blends seamlessly with a wide range of decorating styles, from modern to bohemian. Its clean lines and woven seagrass fibre structure\u0026nbsp;bring warmth and a natural feel, making this light a key decorative element in any room.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- High-Quality Materials:\u003c/strong\u003e Made from fine seagrass fibre strands, this light not only offers a unique aesthetic but also guarantees durability and strength. Seagrass fibre,\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;known for its flexibility and resilience, provides a solid structure while allowing light to filter gently through, creating a soft and relaxing atmosphere.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Compatible with LED E27 Bulbs:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to work with LED E27 bulbs, this light lets you choose the colour temperature and light intensity that best suit your needs. LED bulbs are not only more energy efficient, they also last considerably longer, helping you save on your electricity bill and reducing your environmental impact.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Easy Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Designed to be practical and functional, the seagrass fibre pendant light\u0026nbsp;is easy to install. It comes with all the components needed for assembly, so you can enjoy your new lighting in a matter of minutes, with no complications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Pleasant Atmosphere:\u003c/strong\u003eThe texture of the seagrass fibre\u0026nbsp;diffuses the light softly, creating welcoming and sophisticated spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Sustainability:\u003c/strong\u003e Made from natural materials and compatible with LED bulbs, this light is an eco-friendly choice.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e-Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e It adapts to a wide range of uses, both at home and in commercial settings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses and Applications of the\u0026nbsp;SEAGRASS Pendant Light\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Residential Spaces:\u003c/strong\u003e Ideal for living rooms, dining rooms, bedrooms or any other area of your home where you want to create a warm and elegant atmosphere. Its versatile design fits perfectly in both small and large spaces, adding a touch of distinction.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Commercial Applications:\u003c/strong\u003e Perfect for restaurants, coffee shops, boutiques or waiting areas looking for lighting that is both functional and decorative. The seagrass fibre pendant light\u0026nbsp;does more than illuminate: it becomes a focal point that can enhance your customers\u0027 experience and add aesthetic value to your business.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Event Decoration:\u003c/strong\u003e This light is an excellent option for decorating special events such as weddings, outdoor dinners or themed parties. Its natural, warm style helps create unforgettable settings that capture everyone\u0027s attention.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003e* Bulb NOT INCLUDED\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we guarantee that our products come with a QUALITY warranty and provide all the documentation required for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet for every LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
